WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
So, I think a fair compromise would be

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.320
for me to demonetize all of your videos,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.440
age-restrict half of them,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.960
and take 30% of all of your incoming

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.360
donations.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.760
Sound good?

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.200
Good. Okay, let's get on with the

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.680
process. First, we have the shame stick.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.760
This is to demonetize all of your videos

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.240
and imbue you with shame.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.240
Shame.
